data.studioformatservice#StudioFormatService:
StudioFormatService — the ONE list of what Studio makes (owner, 2026-10-29: “the navigation bar options from the studio are duplicated or incomplete”). Built on the server from the content-skill catalogue plus the generators this deployment really has; the Studio rail, the “Change format” menu and the library’s categories all read it, so they cannot drift.
